  "timeline": {
    "time_to_launch": "NOW|MONTHS|1-2Y|3-5Y",
    "time_to_impact": "NOW|MONTHS|1-2Y|3-5Y"
  },
  "impact_rating": 1,
  "tags": ["string"],
  "addresses_tags": ["string"],
  "side_effect_tags": ["string"],
  "prerequisites_policy_tags": ["string"],
  "synergy_policy_tags": ["string"],
  "role_restrictions": ["string"],
  "art_prompt": "string",
  "flavor_quote": "string"
}

Content constraints:
- Title: 2-4 words, simple and plain-language.
- short_description: <= 60 characters.
- description: 1-2 short sentences, <= 180 characters total.
- Keep the card tangible and easy to explain to a lay audience.
- Prefer policies that change visible conditions in the economy over narrow technical controls.
- budget_cost must be 1-4 and should reflect stage-budget scarcity.
- impact_rating must be 1-5 and reflect expected upside if executed well.
- cost.notes should describe the main tradeoff in simple language.
- Avoid reactive phrasing like "If X happens" or "Response to Y".
- art_prompt must specify an edge-to-edge landscape illustration that fills the entire frame with no empty margins or floating card.

Example:
{
  "id": "policy_labor_reskill_vouchers",
  "title": "Training Vouchers",
  "short_description": "Fast retraining for displaced workers.",
  "description": "Give adults short-course vouchers tied to local hiring demand so layoffs turn into faster re-entry.",
  "category": "Workforce",
  "cost": {
